ion technique where TinyBERT learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT at the pre-training stage.', 'A distillation technique where the student model learns knowledge from the intermediate layers of the teacher model during the pre-training stage.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 4, 4, 4]}, 'English Wikipedia (2,500M words)': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['The text corpus used for general distillation in TinyBERT learning.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'CoLA': {'type': ['task', 'dataset'], 'description': ['A task used to evaluate the performance of TinyBERT, focusing on linguistic acceptability judgments.', 'A dataset used in the evaluation of BERT SMALL.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 4]}, 'Intermediate Layer Distillation': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A knowledge distillation method where the intermediate layers of the teacher model are used to supervise the student model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Batch Size': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The number of training examples utilized in one iteration.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Learning Rate': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['A hyperparameter that controls the step size during optimization.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Epochs': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The number of times the entire training dataset is passed through the model during training.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'BERT-PKD Number of Layers': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The number of layers used for the BERT-PKD baseline model. The text mentions a 4-layer BERT-PKD model was trained.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'DistilBERT Number of Layers': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The number of layers used for the DistilBERT baseline model. The text mentions a 4-layer DistilBERT model was trained.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'CoLA Intermediate Layer Distillation Epochs': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The number of epochs used for intermediate layer distillation for the CoLA task. The text specifies 50 epochs.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Task-Specific Distillation Learning Rate': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The learning rate used during task-specific distillation. The text specifies a learning rate of 5e-5 for intermediate layer distillation and 3e-5 for prediction layer distillation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Task-Specific Distillation Batch Size': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The batch size used during task-specific distillation. The text specifies a batch size of 32.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'SQuAD v1.1': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A question answering dataset used to evaluate TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'SQuAD v2.0': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['Another question answering dataset used to evaluate TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'Question Answering (QA)': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of answering questions based on given context, used to evaluate TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'Stanford Sentiment Treebank': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A binary single-sentence classification task used to predict the sentiment of movie reviews.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'MLM': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Masked Language Modeling, a pre-training task used in BERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'NSP': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Next Sentence Prediction, a pre-training task used in BERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'Transformer distillation': {'description': ['A method for transferring knowledge from a larger Transformer-based model (teacher) to a smaller one (student).', 'A knowledge distillation method specifically designed for Transformer-based models, used to transfer knowledge from teacher BERT to student TinyBERT.', 'A key component of TinyBERT learning, crucial for its performance.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 3]}, 'Knowledge distillation (KD)': {'description': ['A 